                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "If you can code, come and sit with a beginner for an hour. If you can’t, bring snacks. Both are equally useful.",
